hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2299","Ayman bin Khuraim (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Nabi Kareem (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) khutba dene ke liye khade hue aur farmaya: \Aey logo! Jhooti gawahai ko dena Allah ke saath shirk ke barabar hai.\"" Phir Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne tilawat ki: \""Pas buthon ke naapak cheezon se bacho.\"""""""
"2300","Khuraim bin Fatik Al-Asadi (radiyallahu anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Subh (Fajr) ki namaz padhi. Phir jab Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne salam pher aur khade hue to Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Aye logon! Jhooti gawahi Allah ke saath shirk barabar hai.\"" Aap (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne yeh baar baar teen dafa farmaya."""""
"2301","Abdur-Rahman bin Abi Bakrah ne apne walid se riwayat ki hai ke Rasoolullah (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \Kya tumhein sab se bade gunaahon ki khabar na doon?\"" Sab ne kaha: \""Beshak"","" Ya Rasoolullah (s.a.w)!\"" Aap (s.a.w) ne farmaya: \""Allah ke saath shirk karna aur maa baad ki na-farmaani karna.\"""""""
"2302","Imran bin Husain (raziyallahu anhu) ne riwayat ki ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \n\Logon mein behtar meri qaum hai.\"""""""
"2303","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' sab sey achey aur behtar log hamarey zamaney waley hain, phir wo log jo unkey baad hongey, phir wo log jo unkey baad hongey, phir jhoot aam ho jaeyga yahan tak ke aadmi gawahi talab kiye baghair gawahi dega, aur qism khilaaey baghair qism khayega''. aur Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ki wo hadees ke sab sey behtar gawah wo hai, jo gawahi talab kiye baghair gawahi dey to uska mafhoom hamarey nazdik ye hai ke jab kisi sey kisi chiz ki gawahi (haq baat ki khatir) dilwai jaey to wo gawahi dey, gawahi deney sey baaz na rahey, baaz ehle-ilm key nazdik dono hadeeson mein tatbeeq (yaksaniyat) ki yehi surat hai."
